        "TileImage": "$($repository 32fec88b-b82d-4510-b290-09b392592635).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47. Your target is a well-known whistleblower, by the name of Itch &quot;The Splinter&quot; Schultman. He gained a lot of public attention after the infamous ANCHOR expose controversy. Astonishingly, he managed to avoid legal consequences and now, a mere half a year later, he&apos;s aiming to expose the worldwide news giant GNN for their questionable ethics. This time however, he won&apos;t be able to escape fate. \r\rKeep in mind though, you are not the only person who&apos;s after him.",
